# Experimental Parakeet TDT v3 compact storage; observed WER increases in
# the 300 EN/300 DE study. See docs/quantization.md for the paired intervals.
# Requires --imatrix and --shrink-f16 to match the documented size study.
# Named quant levels remain unchanged.
# Explicit rules preserve first-match precedence; put precision overrides first.
default iq2_xxs
^decoder\.prediction\.embed\.weight$ q8_0
^decoder\.prediction\.dec_rnn\.lstm\.weight_(ih|hh)_l[01]$ iq4_nl
^joint\.pred\.weight$ iq4_nl
^joint\.joint_net\.2\.weight$ iq4_nl
